- 신청 내용: `EducationApplicationContent` · `canShowEducationApplicationContent`
- 활동 포기: `withdrawalPhase` · `lastParticipatedSession` · `isWithdrawnBeforeEducation` · `isWithdrawnDuringEducation`
- 안내사항: `EducationInProgressNoticePanel` · `EducationInProgressNoticeDetailModal` · `EducationNoticeStats` · `EducationProgramInfoModal` · `EducationApplicationInfoModal`
